        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At EvlveX, a shoe begins as a story: a seaside court at dusk, a river walked every Sunday, a night train arriving at dawn. We shape leather around that story by hand until it can be worn. Then each pair is numbered, signed by the artisan who finished it, and registered to the person who will carry the story further.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
